{
  "_doc": "SYS-1: the whole system as one declared topology. Every worker, store, queue, index and workflow, with its bindings, is listed here; `python3 -m foundation topology --render` writes each worker's wrangler config, `--check` validates the references, `--drift` compares this file with the live account. state=live means it must exist now; state=planned means the executor is building it (drift reports it as pending, not as a failure). Ids are not secrets; variable values and secrets never appear here (only their names).",
